<!DOCTYPE softwarelist SYSTEM "softwarelist.dtd">
<!--
license:CC0-1.0

    Roland SR-JV80 wave expansion boards, 8 MB each, taken as the mask ROM
    reads: eighteen address lines permuted within each 256 KB block and the
    eight data lines permuted, which is what the socket undoes.  The board
    carries its own label in the clear at offset 0 of the scrambled image,
    "Roland JV80 O.S." and then the sixteen-byte identity the host compares.

    Not dumped: SR-JV80-20 (Ethnic Sound Collection), -21 (Concert Piano)
    and the regional and bundled boards.
-->

